        q: "What does car engine service include in Dubai?",
        a: "Engine service covers everything from routine maintenance to comprehensive internal repairs. A standard engine tune-up includes replacing spark plugs, changing air and fuel filters, cleaning the throttle body, and scanning the engine management system. Major engine service addresses mechanical components: timing belt or chain replacement, cylinder head gasket repair, oil and coolant leak rectification, cooling system overhauls, and complete engine rebuilds or replacement."
    },
    {
        q: "How do I know whether my engine needs a minor repair, an overhaul, or replacement?",
        a: "A minor repair or tune-up is appropriate when issues are isolated to external components such as spark plugs, coils, sensors, or gaskets. An engine overhaul is necessary when internal wear occurs -such as worn piston rings, damaged cylinder walls, worn crankshaft bearings, or severe valve leakage. A complete engine replacement (new, reconditioned, or tested low-mileage used unit) is usually recommended when severe catastrophic damage occurs, such as a cracked block, thrown connecting rod, or when the overhaul cost exceeds the replacement value."
    },
